# Atlas interface

- The map is the page. Panels are margins. One path to each system: what it is, why, the price, the result.
- Layout rectangles live in `game/gui/`. Palette tokens live in `game/interface/`. A reskin does not require a new screen class.
- Clouds, mist, and map modes change drawing only. They do not reveal hidden armies or alter supply.
- Check Russian and English at 1920×1080 and 1280×720. Long labels scroll or wrap inside a bounded drawer. They do not push the shell off the screen.
- A control that spends money, signs a deal, or moves an army uses the existing command. A navigation button does not.
